ource-208779-208782">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-208782-208797"><rb>犯</rb><rt>をか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-208797-208836">し行かれしとて思ふ如き鳥も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-208836-208851"><rb>罹</rb><rt>かゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-208851-208860">るまじ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-208860-208875"><rb>先</rb><rt>まづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-208875-208884">今日は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-208884-208899"><rb>罷</rb><rt>やめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-208899-208935">に致し玉へ手柄は何時でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-208935-208950"><rb>成</rb><rt>でき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-208950-208959">る事と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-208959-208983"><rb>押止</rb><rt>おしとゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-208983-209001">めけれど思ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-209001-209016"><rb>込</rb><rt>こみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-209016-209103">たる左京は更に聞き入れず思立しが吉日なり是非とも參りたしと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-209103-209118"><rb>強</rb><rt>たつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-209118-209124">ての</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-209124-209148"><rb>懇望</rb><rt>こんまう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-209148-209157">なれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-209157-209178"><rb>然程</rb><rt>さほど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-209178-209220">に思はれなば兎も角もと手下の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-209220-209244"><rb>小賊</rb><rt>せうぞく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-209244-209247">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-209247-209274"><rb>貸與</rb><rt>かしあたへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-209274-209292">たれば左京は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-209292-209316"><rb>欣然</rb><rt>きんぜん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-209316-209328">と支度を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-209328-209346"><rb>調</rb><rt>とゝの</rt