-719177"><rb>短見</rb><rt>はやまり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-719177-719189">給ふなと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-719189-719210"><rb>異見</rb><rt>いけん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-719210-719228">をなし妻にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-719228-719252"><rb>能々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-719237-719243">よく</seg><choice source="#source-719243-719249"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-719252-719276"><rb>云付</rb><rt>いひつけ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-719276-719291"><rb>置</rb><rt>おき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-719291-719327">長屋の者を頼みて平兵衞は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-719327-719351"><rb>早々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-719336-719342">さう</seg><choice source="#source-719342-719348"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-719351-719372"><rb>調度</rb><rt>したく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-719372-719381">をなし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-719381-719405"><rb>下總</rb><rt>しもふさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-719405-719420">の古河へぞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-719420-719438"><rb>赴</rb><rt>おもむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-719438-719451">きける</seg></p>
