><rt>へんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-774663-774666">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-774666-774684"><rb>認</rb><rt>したゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-774684-774687">め</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-774687-774702"><rb>遣</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-774702-774717">はしける其</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-774717-774735"><rb>文</rb><rt>ぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-774735-774746">に曰く</seg></p>
