775177"><rb>娘儀</rb><rt>むすめぎ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775177-775201"><rb>出府</rb><rt>しゆつぷ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-775201-775246">致されべく候吉原町にも病家も有</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-775246-775258">レ</note><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775258-775279"><rb>之</rb><rt>これあり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-775279-775285">候間</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775285-775303"><rb>宜</rb><rt>よろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-775303-775315">しき先を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775315-775336"><rb>見立</rb><rt>みたて</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775336-775360"><rb>奉公</rb><rt>ほうこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-775360-775363">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775363-775387"><rb>差遣</rb><rt>さしつか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-775387-775399">はし可申</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775399-775417"><rb>何</rb><rt>いづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-775417-775468">れ出府の上御相談に及ぶべく候委細は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775468-775489"><rb>筆紙</rb><rt>ひつし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-775489-775492">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775492-775507"><rb>盡</rb><rt>つく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-775507-775516">し難く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-775516-775540"><rb>早々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-775525-775531">さう</seg><choice source="#source-775531-775537"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-775540-775548">以上</seg></p>
