        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-859399-875644"><seg source="#source-859399-859408">時に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859408-859444"><rb>彼町醫師</rb><rt>かのまちいし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859444-859477">村井長庵は既に十兵衞を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859477-859501"><rb>殺害</rb><rt>せつがい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859501-859531">し奪ひ取たる五十兩又</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859531-859552"><rb>妹</rb><rt>いもと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859552-859564">お富をも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859564-859588"><rb>賣代</rb><rt>うりしろ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859588-859600"><rb>爲</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859600-859606">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859606-859621"><rb>掠</rb><rt>かす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859621-859645">め取たる金までも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859645-859672"><rb>悉皆</rb><rt><seg source="#source-859654-859660">こと</seg><choice source="#source-859660-859669"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859672-859675">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859675-859690"><rb>遣</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859690-859693">ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859693-859708"><rb>捨</rb><rt>すて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859708-859732">今は早一文なしの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859732-859747"><rb>素</rb><rt>もと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859747-859750">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859750-859771"><rb>形相</rb><rt>すがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859771-859795">と成りければ又候</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859795-859819"><rb>奸智</rb><rt>かんち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-859819-859822">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-859822-859837"><rb>巡</rb><rt>