        <p source="#source-909148-910013"><seg source="#source-909148-909160">斯の如く</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-909187-909247"><lem><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909160-909178"><rb>認</rb><rt>したゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909178-909187">めたる</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-909229-909241">認めにる</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-909247-909277">一通なれば六右衞門は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909277-909304"><rb>押戴</rb><rt>おしいたゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909304-909400">き若旦那の御心遣ひ有り難く存じ上ます然らば此一通は私し方慥かに御</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909400-909421"><rb>預</rb><rt>あづか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909421-909481">り申さんとて久八へ渡しける時に千太郎又々</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909481-909511"><rb>懷中</rb><rt>くわいちう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909511-909529">より金子一と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909529-909544"><rb>包</rb><rt>つゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909544-909556">み取出し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909556-909580"><rb>追々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-909565-909571">おひ</seg><choice source="#source-909571-909577"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909580-909601"><rb>見繼</rb><rt>みつぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909601-909640">も致す心なれども是は當座の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909640-909655"><rb>凌</rb><rt>しの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909655-909682">ぎの爲實父の方より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909682-909706"><rb>借受</rb><rt>かりうけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909706-909784">し金子なり之を遣ひ居て下されよと出すを久八はおし返し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909784-909799"><rb>達</rb><rt>たつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909799-909802">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909802-909823"><rb>辭退</rb><rt>じたい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909823-909856">をなしけれども千太郎は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909856-909868"><rb>猶</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909868-909871">ほ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909871-909898"><rb>種々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-909880-909886">さま</seg><choice source="#source-909886-909895"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909898-909913">に言ひなし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909913-909937"><rb>漸々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-909922-909928">やう</seg><choice source="#source-909928-909934"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909937-909946">金子を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-909946-909970"><rb>差置</rb><rt>さしおき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-909970-910013">つゝ我が家へこそは歸りけれ</seg></p>
