><seg source="#source-975651-975708">きなり忠兵衞に於ては胡亂なる儀申立ては</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-975708-975732"><rb>相濟</rb><rt>あひすま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-975732-975744">んぞ心を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-975744-975759"><rb>鎭</rb><rt>しづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-975759-975822">めて對決に及ぶべしと申渡されける依て三人は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-975822-975837"><rb>顏</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-975837-975873">を見合せ居たりしが忠兵衞</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-975873-975891"><rb>頓</rb><rt>やが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-975891-975927">て長庵に向ひ長庵殿如何に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-975927-975948"><rb>貴殿</rb><rt>きでん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-975948-975951">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-975951-975966"><rb>恨</rb><rt>うら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-975966-976002">み有などと云ふ事は思ひも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-976002-976017"><rb>寄</rb><rt>よら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-976017-976020">ず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-976020-976035"><rb>然</rb><rt>され</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-976035-976056">ども八ヶ年以前</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-976074-976146"><lem><seg source="#source-976056-976074">八月廿八日の</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-976122-976140">八年廿八日の</seg></rdg></app><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-976146-976164"><rb>曉</rb><rt>あかつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-976164-976167">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-976167-976182"><rb>方</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-976182-976203">平川天神へ私し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-976203-976227"><rb>朝參</rb><rt>あさまゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-976227-976233">りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-976233-976248"><rb>戻</rb><rt>もど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-976248-976251">り</seg><ruby type="fu