        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-988933-996922"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-988936-988951"><rb>爰</rb><rt>こゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-988951-988978">に又伊勢屋五兵衞の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-988978-988999"><rb>養子</rb><rt>やうし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-988999-989011">千太郎は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989011-989026"><rb>舊</rb><rt>もと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989026-989044">の番頭久八が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989044-989062"><rb>情</rb><rt>なさけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989062-989068">にて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989068-989086"><rb>己</rb><rt>おのれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989086-989089">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989089-989113"><rb>引負</rb><rt>ひきおひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989113-989143">の金迄も久八が自分に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989143-989167"><rb>引請</rb><rt>ひきうけ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989167-989182"><rb>終</rb><rt>つひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989182-989206">に是が爲に久八は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989206-989230"><rb>年來</rb><rt>ねんらい</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989230-989245"><rb>勤</rb><rt>つと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989245-989248">め</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989248-989275"><rb>白鼠</rb><rt>しろねずみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989275-989299">と云れし功も水の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989299-989314"><rb>泡</rb><rt>あわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989314-989329">となし永の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989329-989347"><rb>暇</rb><rt>いとま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989347-989368">と成し事其身を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-989368-989383"><rb>捨</rb><rt>すて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989383-989386">て</seg><ruby