">見受候まゝ私し異見を爲し樣子を承まはり候へば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014129-1014156"><rb>云々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-1014138-1014144">しか</seg><choice source="#source-1014144-1014153"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014156-1014192">なりと申に付千太郎の一時</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014192-1014210"><rb>店</rb><rt>みせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014210-1014216">より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014216-1014240"><rb>持出</rb><rt>もちいだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014240-1014264">せし五十兩を私し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014264-1014297"><rb>引負金</rb><rt>ひきおひきん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014297-1014300">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014300-1014315"><rb>爲</rb><rt>なし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014315-1014324">て永の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014324-1014342"><rb>暇</rb><rt>いとま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014342-1014369">になりし節千太郎へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014369-1014396"><rb>呉々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-1014378-1014384">くれ</seg><choice source="#source-1014384-1014393"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014396-1014414">異見を申以後</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014414-1014438"><rb>急度</rb><rt>きつと</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014438-1014456"><rb>愼</rb><rt>つゝし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014456-1014483">み候筈に付私し儀も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014483-1014498"><rb>嬉</rb><rt>うれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014498-1014564">しく存じ五十兩の金子は今以て私しより少しづつ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014564-1014588"><rb>返濟</rb><rt>へんさい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1014588-1014633">致し居候然るに先日私し事千住の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1014633-1014675"><rb>紙屑問屋</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#s