        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1124984-1130328"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1124987-1125002"><rb>斯</rb><rt>かく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125002-1125023">て傳吉は小娘に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125023-1125047"><rb>誘引</rb><rt>いざなは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125047-1125050">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125050-1125062"><rb>許</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125062-1125089">ある家に入て見れば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125089-1125107"><rb>柱</rb><rt>はしら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125107-1125110">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125110-1125125"><rb>曲</rb><rt>まが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125125-1125131">りて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125131-1125146"><rb>倒</rb><rt>たふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125146-1125149">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125149-1125164"><rb>軒</rb><rt>のき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125164-1125167">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125167-1125185"><rb>傾</rb><rt>かたぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125185-1125194">き屋根</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125194-1125212"><rb>落</rb><rt>おち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125212-1125227">ていかにも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125227-1125248"><rb>貧家</rb><rt>ひんか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125248-1125275">の有樣なれば傳吉は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125275-1125299"><rb>跡先</rb><rt>あとさき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125299-1125365">見回し今更立ち出んも如何と見合ける中に小娘は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125365-1125383"><rb>盥</rb><rt>たらひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125383-1125386">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1125386-1125407"><rb>温湯</rb><rt>ぬるゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1125407-1125410">を</seg><ruby ty