pe="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1198641-1198656"><rb>嘆</rb><rt>なげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1198656-1198659">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1198659-1198674"><rb>悲</rb><rt>かな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1198674-1198689">しめ共今は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1198689-1198713"><rb>詮方</rb><rt>せんかた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1198713-1198734">なく種々に心を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1198734-1198749"><rb>痛</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1198749-1198762">めたり</seg></p>
