        <p source="#source-1412527-1412918"><seg source="#source-1412527-1412539">右の通り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412539-1412566"><rb>出役</rb><rt>しゆつやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1412566-1412572">の者</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412572-1412599"><rb>取調</rb><rt>とりしら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1412599-1412659">べし上書付二通大岡越前守殿へ差出しけるに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412659-1412674"><rb>依</rb><rt>よつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1412674-1412692">て越州殿には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412692-1412707"><rb>扨</rb><rt>さて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1412707-1412713">こそ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412713-1412740"><rb>推量</rb><rt>すゐりやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1412740-1412743">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412743-1412758"><rb>違</rb><rt>たが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1412758-1412770">はず外に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412770-1412794"><rb>惡賊</rb><rt>あくぞく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1412794-1412815">有ことと是より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412815-1412833"><rb>專</rb><rt>もつぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1412833-1412848">ら其本人を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412848-1412872"><rb>種々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-1412857-1412863">いろ</seg><choice source="#source-1412863-1412869"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1412872-1412893"><rb>詮議</rb><rt>せんぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1412893-1412918">されけるとなん</seg></p>
