29369"><rb>座頭</rb><rt>ざとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429369-1429405">は幸手の富右衞門とやらの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429405-1429426"><rb>由縁</rb><rt>ゆかり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429426-1429447">の人と見えるが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429447-1429462"><rb>何</rb><rt>どう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429462-1429477">だ少しでも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429477-1429498"><rb>酒代</rb><rt>さかて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429498-1429501">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429501-1429516"><rb>貰</rb><rt>もら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429516-1429522">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429522-1429537"><rb>首</rb><rt>くび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429537-1429540">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429540-1429555"><rb>遣</rb><rt>やら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429555-1429594">うではないかと相談なしモシ</seg><choice source="#source-1429594-1429600"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429600-1429627"><rb>御座頭</rb><rt>おざとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429627-1429663">さん高くは云れねへが首を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429663-1429678"><rb>極</rb><rt>ごく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429678-1429705"><rb>内證</rb><rt>ないしよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429705-1429717">でお前に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429717-1429732"><rb>進</rb><rt>あげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429732-1429777">ませうと云ふを城富聞より大いに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429777-1429801"><rb>喜悦</rb><rt>よろこび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429801-1429807">夫は</seg><choice source="#source-1429807-1429813"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1429813-1429831"><rb>誠</rb><rt>まこと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1429831-1429873">に有がたう御座ると云ば非人共</seg><ruby type="furigana" ren