        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1457434-1464503"><seg source="#source-1457434-1457458">扨も八田掃部は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457458-1457485"><rb>騫直</rb><rt>まつしぐら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457485-1457488">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457488-1457512"><rb>追懸</rb><rt>おつかけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457512-1457539">來りしが三五郎めは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457539-1457557"><rb>慥</rb><rt>たしか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457557-1457569">に此寺に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457569-1457593"><rb>迯込</rb><rt>にげこん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457593-1457638">だるに相違無しと御寺へ駈入眼を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457638-1457653"><rb>配</rb><rt>くば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457653-1457686">りながら住持に向ひ若し</seg><choice source="#source-1457686-1457692"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-1457692-1457695">御</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457695-1457722"><rb>寺樣</rb><rt>てらさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457722-1457743">只今人を殺して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457743-1457767"><rb>立退</rb><rt>たちのき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457767-1457785">し者が此寺へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457785-1457809"><rb>駈込</rb><rt>かけこみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457809-1457857">しを慥に見屆たり何所に居り候やお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457857-1457869"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457869-1457890">し下さる可しと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457890-1457908"><rb>尋</rb><rt>たづね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457908-1457926">ければ住持は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457926-1457941"><rb>聞</rb><rt>きゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1457941-1457944">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1457944-1457956"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt