rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463050-1463077">うと二人相談をなし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463077-1463092"><rb>頓</rb><rt>やが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463092-1463179">て此寺を立出けり其時畔倉重四郎は彼等が相談せし樣子を天井に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463179-1463200"><rb>潜伏</rb><rt>かくれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463200-1463203">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463203-1463218"><rb>逐</rb><rt>ちく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463218-1463239">一聞屆け時分は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463239-1463254"><rb>好</rb><rt>よし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463254-1463266">と天井を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463266-1463287"><rb>飛降</rb><rt>とびお</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463287-1463305">り和尚を見に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463305-1463320"><rb>釣</rb><rt>つる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463320-1463335">し上られた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463335-1463350"><rb>儘</rb><rt>まゝ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463350-1463362"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463362-1463392">したる體ゆゑ重四郎も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463392-1463413"><rb>流石</rb><rt>さすが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463413-1463455">氣の毒に思ひハヽア僧主は僧主</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463455-1463473"><rb>丈</rb><rt>だけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463473-1463491">正直な者然し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463491-1463515"><rb>打殺</rb><rt>うちころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463515-1463557">さるゝ迄云ぬと言ふは武士にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463557-1463572"><rb>優</rb><rt>まし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1463572-1463584">た丈夫な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463584-1463608"><rb>精神</rb><rt>たましひ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1463608-1463644"><rb>天晴々々</rb><rt><seg sour