rb>引寄</rb><rt>ひきよせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464133-1464142">十分に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464142-1464166"><rb>食終</rb><rt>くひをは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464166-1464178">り夫より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464178-1464202"><rb>悠然</rb><rt><seg source="#source-1464187-1464193">いう</seg><choice source="#source-1464193-1464199"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464202-1464247">と幸手宿へ立歸り此由を三五郎に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464247-1464262"><rb>咄</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464262-1464274">し密かに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464274-1464289"><rb>喋</rb><rt>しめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464289-1464328">し合せ彼等の子分が金兵衞の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464328-1464346"><rb>敵</rb><rt>かたき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464346-1464349">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464349-1464364"><rb>狙</rb><rt>ねら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464364-1464379">ひ來る時は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464379-1464412"><rb>斯樣々々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-1464394-1464403">かやう</seg><choice source="#source-1464403-1464409"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464412-1464415">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464415-1464439"><rb>手配</rb><rt>てくばり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464439-1464457">を成して用心</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1464457-1464481"><rb>堅固</rb><rt>けんご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1464481-1464503">に居たりけり</seg></p>
