2-1752836">な惡ひ奴が來るか計られねば早く見世を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1752836-1752854"><rb>仕廻</rb><rt>しま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1752854-1752869">つて休むが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1752869-1752884"><rb>好</rb><rt>いゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1752884-1752917">といふに下男彌助何さま</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1752917-1752938"><rb>然樣</rb><rt>さやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1752938-1752968">致さんと早々に見世を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1752968-1752983"><rb>片</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1752983-1752989">つけ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1752989-1753004"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1753004-1753010">戸を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1753010-1753025"><rb>建</rb><rt>たて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1753025-1753043">んとする處へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1753043-1753064"><rb>見上</rb><rt>みあぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1753064-1753088">る如き大兵の武士</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1753088-1753106"><rb>鐵</rb><rt>てつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1753106-1753109">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1753109-1753136"><rb>禪杖</rb><rt>ぜんぢやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1753136-1753154">を引さげつか</seg><choice source="#source-1753154-1753160"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-1753160-1753163">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1753163-1753184"><rb>這入</rb><rt>はひり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1753184-1753235">來り是々若いもの酒を一升かんをして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1753235-1753247"><rb>呉</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1753247-1753250">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1753250-1753262"><rb>然</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1753262-1753271">うして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1753271-1753286"><rb>何</rb><rt>