        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1791600-1797543"><seg source="#source-1791600-1791648">扨寶珠花屋八五郎は後藤の出行し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791648-1791663"><rb>後</rb><rt>のち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791663-1791687"><rb>早々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-1791672-1791678">さう</seg><choice source="#source-1791678-1791684"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1791687-1791711">下男の彌助にいひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791711-1791726"><rb>付</rb><rt>つけ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791726-1791741"><rb>先</rb><rt>まづ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791741-1791765"><rb>燒酎</rb><rt>せうちう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791765-1791786"><rb>鷄卵</rb><rt>たまご</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791786-1791825"><rb>白木綿等</rb><rt>しろもめんとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1791825-1791828">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791828-1791855"><rb>買調</rb><rt>かひとゝの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1791855-1791867">へ夫より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791867-1791888"><rb>外科</rb><rt>げくわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1791888-1791915">へ怪我人ある趣き申</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791915-1791936"><rb>遣</rb><rt>つかは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1791936-1791954">し招きけるに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791954-1791972"><rb>醫師</rb><rt>いし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1791972-1791981">は幸ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1791981-1792008"><rb>在宿</rb><rt>ざいしゆく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1792008-1792032">なればとて彌助に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1792032-1792056"><rb>藥籠</rb><rt>やくろう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1792056-1792074">を持せて先へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#sourc