        <p source="#source-1859813-1868190"><seg source="#source-1859813-1859816">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859816-1859831"><rb>年</rb><rt>とし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1859831-1859834">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859834-1859846"><rb>尾</rb><rt>を</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1859846-1859849">や</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859849-1859864"><rb>水</rb><rt>みづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1859864-1859867">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859867-1859882"><rb>流</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1859882-1859888">れと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859888-1859903"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1859903-1859906">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859906-1859918"><rb>身</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby>は」とは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859930-1859942"><rb>彼</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1859942-1859960">の大高源吾が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859960-1859984"><rb>門飾</rb><rt>かどかざ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1859984-1859996">りの竹を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1859996-1860026"><rb>賣歩行</rb><rt>うりあるき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1860026-1860029">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1860029-1860044"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1860044-1860065"><rb>晋子</rb><rt>しんし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1860065-1860086"><rb>其角</rb><rt>きかく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1860086-1860098">が贈りし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1860098-1860128"><rb>述懷</rb><rt>じゆつくわい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1860128-1860131">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1860131-1860155"><rb>名吟</rb><rt>めいぎん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1860155-1860197">なる事は世の人の知る所にして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend