">て金の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1871995-1872019"><rb>調達</rb><rt>てうだつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872019-1872037">するより外の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872037-1872058"><rb>工夫</rb><rt>くふう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872058-1872079">はなしと恩義に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872079-1872094"><rb>迫</rb><rt>せま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872094-1872127">りし夫婦が相談茲に漸く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872127-1872145"><rb>調</rb><rt>とゝの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872145-1872172">ひしかば娘お幸を一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872172-1872187"><rb>間</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872187-1872190">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872190-1872205"><rb>招</rb><rt>まね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872205-1872223">き妻のお梅は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872223-1872241"><rb>涙</rb><rt>なみだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872241-1872250">ながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872250-1872274"><rb>此度</rb><rt>このたび</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872274-1872307"><rb>斯樣々々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-1872289-1872298">かやう</seg><choice source="#source-1872298-1872304"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872307-1872367">の譯にて是非ともなければならぬ金ゆゑ親の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872367-1872382"><rb>爲</rb><rt>ため</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872382-1872388">長い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872388-1872406"><rb>間</rb><rt>あひだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872406-1872436">でも有まじければ何卒</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872436-1872457"><rb>勤</rb><rt>つとめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872457-1872475">の奉公をして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1872475-1872490"><rb>呉</rb><rt>くれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1872490-1872562">よと