        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-2048044-2057351"><seg source="#source-2048044-2048074">扨又長兵衞は願書を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048074-2048089"><rb>認</rb><rt>した</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048089-2048119">ためんとするに先より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048119-2048137"><rb>傍</rb><rt>かたは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048137-2048143">らに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048143-2048158"><rb>酒</rb><rt>さけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048158-2048161">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048161-2048182"><rb>呑居</rb><rt>のみゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048182-2048251">たりし後藤半四郎は長八が話しを聞夫は何にしても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048251-2048263"><rb>氣</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048263-2048266">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048266-2048281"><rb>毒</rb><rt>どく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048281-2048332">なる事なり併し其金を返せし處は實に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048332-2048362"><rb>頼母敷</rb><rt>たのもしき</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048362-2048386"><rb>心底</rb><rt>しんてい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048386-2048401">なるが今の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048401-2048416"><rb>咄</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048416-2048422">しの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048422-2048443"><rb>樣子</rb><rt>やうす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048443-2048482">にては其大橋氏へ百兩の金が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048482-2048506"><rb>紛失</rb><rt>ふんじつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048506-2048515">したと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048515-2048539"><rb>言懸</rb><rt>いひがか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2048539-2048566">りし油屋の番頭こそ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2048566-2048590"><rb>不屆</rb><rt>ふとゞき</rt></ruby><seg source