" rend="right" source="#source-2059500-2059527"><rb>翌日</rb><rt>よくじつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2059527-2059605">に相成ければ後藤半四郎は長兵衞八五郎同道にて山崎町へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2059605-2059620"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆき</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2059620-2059635"><rb>先</rb><rt>まづ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2059635-2059659"><rb>仲人</rb><rt>なかうど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2059659-2059722">の山田屋佐兵衞方へ立より今日は是非々々娘が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2059722-2059755"><rb>離縁状</rb><rt>りえんじやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2059755-2059758">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2059758-2059776"><rb>貰</rb><rt>もらは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2059776-2059818">ねばならず夫に付我等兄弟共へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2059818-2059833"><rb>咄</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2059833-2059845">せし所が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2059845-2059875"><rb>持參金</rb><rt>ぢさんきん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2059875-2059941">衣類道具等までも損をして離縁状計り取とは餘り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2059941-2059965"><rb>馬鹿氣</rb><rt>ばかげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2059965-2059977">た事とて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2059977-2060007"><rb>不承知</rb><rt>ふしようち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2060007-2060028">を申餘り無法の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2060028-2060052"><rb>挨拶</rb><rt>あいさつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2060052-2060157">なりと云に付今日其弟を同道して參りしなり御苦勞ながら御出下されよと云に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2060157-2060181"><rb>仲人</rb><rt>なかうど</rt></ruby><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-2060193-2060253"><lem><seg source="#source-2060181-2060193">佐兵衞は</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-2060235-2060247">左兵衞は</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-2060253-2060259">是を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20602