        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-2106833-2121111"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2106836-2106857"><rb>却説</rb><rt>さても</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2106857-2106887">油屋五兵衞は町役人に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2106887-2106905"><rb>伴</rb><rt>ともな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2106905-2106932">はれ坂本の自身番へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2106932-2106947"><rb>到</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2106947-2106956">りしに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2106956-2106983"><rb>豫々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-2106965-2106971">かね</seg><choice source="#source-2106971-2106980"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2106983-2106989">心を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2106989-2107004"><rb>緩</rb><rt>ゆる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107004-2107010">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107010-2107037"><rb>召仕</rb><rt>めしつかひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107037-2107073">し番頭久兵衞は高手小手に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107073-2107091"><rb>縛</rb><rt>いまし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107091-2107148">められ居たるゆゑ五兵衞は久兵衞を見るや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107148-2107163"><rb>否</rb><rt>いな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107163-2107166">や</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107166-2107184"><rb>汝</rb><rt>おのれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107184-2107187">は</seg><choice source="#source-2107187-2107193"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107193-2107235"><rb>人面獸心</rb><rt>にんめんじうしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107235-2107256">なる奴かな五年</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107256-2107283"><rb>以來</rb><rt>このかた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107283-2107331">目を懸て遣はしたる恩を忘れよくも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107331-2107349"><rb>悴</rb><rt>せがれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107349-2107361">五郎藏を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107361-2107385"><rb>突殺</rb><rt>つきころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107385-2107430">し金銀質物を盜み出せしよな悴の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107430-2107448"><rb>敵</rb><rt>かたき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107448-2107481">思ひ知れやと云ながらも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107481-2107505"><rb>飛懸</rb><rt>とびかゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107505-2107511">りて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107511-2107535"><rb>押伏</rb><rt>おしふせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107535-2107583">んとするゆゑ役人は聲をかけコリヤ</seg><choice source="#source-2107583-2107589"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-2107589-2107598">五兵衞</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107598-2107616"><rb>控</rb><rt>ひか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107616-2107619">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107619-2107631"><rb>居</rb><rt>を</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107631-2107646">れ此方にて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107646-2107670"><rb>召捕</rb><rt>めしとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107670-2107685">たる罪人を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107685-2107706"><rb>手込</rb><rt>てごめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107706-2107760">にせんとは不屆なり愼んで此方の調べを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107760-2107775"><rb>受</rb><rt>うけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107775-2107781">よと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107781-2107796"><rb>叱</rb><rt>しか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107796-2107799">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107799-2107814"><rb>付</rb><rt>つけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107814-2107853">るに五兵衞はハツと心付是は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107853-2107871"><rb>實</rb><rt>まこと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107871-2107895">に恐れ入り奉つる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107895-2107916"><rb>彼奴</rb><rt>かやつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107916-2107982">に悴を殺されたる無念の餘り御役人樣の御前をも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2107982-2107997"><rb>忘</rb><rt>わす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2107997-2108000">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108000-2108021"><rb>不禮</rb><rt>ぶれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2108021-2108036">仕つり候段</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108036-2108087"><rb>眞平御免下</rb><rt>まつぴらごめんくだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2108087-2108120">さるべしと云ば役人聞て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108120-2108132"><rb>夫</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2108132-2108153">は不便の儀なり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108153-2108168"><rb>而</rb><rt>して</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2108168-2108228">又其手續きは如何なる事ぞと尋ぬるに五兵衞</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108228-2108246"><rb>渠</rb><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2108246-2108297">は私し方へ五ヶ年以前より奉公に參り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108297-2108318"><rb>至極</rb><rt>しごく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108318-2108342"><rb>實體</rb><rt>じつてい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2108342-2108351">に勤め</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108351-2108366"><rb>居</rb><rt>をり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2108366-2108411">ますゆゑ年頃も相應に付き番頭に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108411-2108435"><rb>取立</rb><rt>とりたて</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108435-2108450"><rb>店</rb><rt>みせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2108450-2108462">の事ども</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108462-2108477"><rb>任</rb><rt>まか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2108477-2108549">せ置候處今宵悴五郎藏を殺害仕つり金子三百五十兩を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2108549-2108564"><rb>盜</rb><rt>ぬす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source