furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2274911-2274932"><rb>寅刻</rb><rt>なゝつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2274932-2274959">に立出て板橋の方へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2274959-2274974"><rb>到</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2274974-2275007">り吾助を尋ぬれども何の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275007-2275028"><rb>手係</rb><rt>てがか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275028-2275085">りもなきにぞ然らば千住の方を尋ねんとて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275085-2275124"><rb>飛鳥山下</rb><rt>あすかやました</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275124-2275160">通りより段々千住の方へと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275160-2275178"><rb>赴</rb><rt>おもむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275178-2275211">く途中にて五六人の男が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275211-2275232"><rb>歩行</rb><rt>あるき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275232-2275244">ながらの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275244-2275262"><rb>噂</rb><rt>うはさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275262-2275265">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275265-2275289"><rb>今朝</rb><rt>こんてう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275289-2275301">千住にて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275301-2275325"><rb>召捕</rb><rt>めしとら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275325-2275346">れたる者有しが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275346-2275367"><rb>小鬢</rb><rt>こびん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275367-2275379">に餘程の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275379-2275394"><rb>古</rb><rt>ふる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275394-2275397">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275397-2275424"><rb>太刀疵</rb><rt>たちきず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275424-2275451">の有程の者故何でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275451-2275475"><rb>只者</rb><rt>たゞもの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2275475-2275517">には有まじと云を聞て友次郎は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2275