seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332228-2332255"><rb>此儘</rb><rt>このまゝ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332255-2332270"><rb>爰</rb><rt>こゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332270-2332318">には差置參らせ難し此儀如何せんと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332318-2332342"><rb>相談</rb><rt>さうだん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332342-2332369">せしかば惣右衞門は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332369-2332393"><rb>點頭</rb><rt>うなづき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332393-2332402">其儀は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332402-2332417"><rb>先</rb><rt>せん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332417-2332456">殿樣の御恩に成し御出入りの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332456-2332483"><rb>陸尺</rb><rt>ろくしやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332483-2332516">七右衞門は男氣の者にて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332516-2332546"><rb>須田町</rb><rt>すだちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332546-2332591">一丁目に住居致せば此者を頼みて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332591-2332606"><rb>渠</rb><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332606-2332630">か方へ御二方共に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332630-2332648"><rb>竊</rb><rt>ひそか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332648-2332720">に忍ばせ申さんと某し豫てより思ひしか共此病氣にて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332720-2332735"><rb>渠</rb><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332735-2332801">の方へ行事能はず夫故未だ渠には申談ぜざれども</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332801-2332822"><rb>貴殿</rb><rt>きでん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332822-2332846">より御頼みあらば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332846-2332870"><rb>承知</rb><rt>しようち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332870-2332885"><rb>致</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2332885-2332921">さんと云に郷右衞門其儀は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2332921-2332942"><rb>至極</rb><rt>しごく</rt></ruby><