        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-2381493-2385326"><seg source="#source-2381493-2381514">偖も大岡殿は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381514-2381541"><rb>退出</rb><rt>たいしゆつ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381541-2381553"><rb>後</rb><rt>ご</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381553-2381577"><rb>早速</rb><rt>さつそく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381577-2381592"><rb>佐</rb><rt>すけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2381592-2381598">十郎</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381598-2381616"><rb>郷</rb><rt>がう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2381616-2381637">右衞門の兩人を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381637-2381652"><rb>呼</rb><rt>よび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2381652-2381667">出し今度の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381667-2381688"><rb>趣意</rb><rt>しゆい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2381688-2381691">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381691-2381706"><rb>尋</rb><rt>たづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2381706-2381739">ねられければ兩人謹んで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381739-2381763"><rb>平伏</rb><rt>へいふく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2381763-2381799">なし私し主人の先代平助儀</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381799-2381826"><rb>當主</rb><rt>たうしゆ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381826-2381862"><rb>主税之助</rb><rt>ちからのすけ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381862-2381883"><rb>養子</rb><rt>やうし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2381883-2381886">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381886-2381901"><rb>參</rb><rt>まゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2381901-2381922">られ候後兩人の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2381922-2381943"><rb>男子</rb><rt>だんし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2381943-2381946">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source