55281-2455299"><rb>漸</rb><rt>やうや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455299-2455344">く喧嘩も鎭り屋敷へ歸りし後此事</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455344-2455371"><rb>内濟</rb><rt>ないさい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455371-2455377">にて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455377-2455401"><rb>相濟</rb><rt>あひすみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455401-2455437">たり然れ共私し儀首筋より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455437-2455449"><rb>脊</rb><rt>せ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455449-2455452">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455452-2455464"><rb>掛</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455464-2455470">けて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455470-2455494"><rb>大疵</rb><rt>おほきず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455494-2455527">あるに付其時より異名を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455527-2455551"><rb>切首</rb><rt>きりくび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455551-2455578">と人々申候と少しく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455578-2455599"><rb>自慢</rb><rt>じまん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455599-2455611">がてらに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455611-2455635"><rb>長々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-2455620-2455626">なが</seg><choice source="#source-2455626-2455632"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455635-2455668">と申ければ大岡殿成程其</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455668-2455692"><rb>遺恨</rb><rt>ゐこん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455692-2455728">もある故陸尺の七右衞門は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455728-2455752"><rb>今度</rb><rt>このたび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455752-2455782">の一件に世話を致して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455782-2455794"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455794-2455809">ると見ゆる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2455809-2455821"><rb>先</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2455821-2455830">づ夫は</se