rb>智恩院</rb><rt>ちおんゐん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2456391-2456394">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456394-2456412"><rb>弟子</rb><rt>でし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2456412-2456451">なりしかと申さるゝに多兵衞</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456451-2456469"><rb>否</rb><rt>いへ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456469-2456490"><rb>然樣</rb><rt>さやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2456490-2456523">でも御座りませぬ然らば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456523-2456538"><rb>何</rb><rt>どう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2456538-2456571">ぢやヘイ弟願山儀は江戸</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456571-2456592"><rb>表</rb><rt>おもて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2456592-2456595">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456595-2456610"><rb>寺</rb><rt>てら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2456610-2456616">にて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456616-2456640"><rb>出家</rb><rt>しゆつけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2456640-2456727">致せしと申すを大岡殿ナニ江戸表の寺ぢや江戸表とばかりでは一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456727-2456745"><rb>向</rb><rt>かう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456745-2456760"><rb>解</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2456760-2456787">らず何と申寺なるや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2456787-2456811"><rb>眞直</rb><rt>まつすぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2456811-2456839">に申せと云れけり</seg></p>
