        <p source="#source-2473828-2473914"><seg source="#source-2473828-2473843">ちはやふる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2473843-2473864"><rb>神代</rb><rt>かみよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2473864-2473867">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2473867-2473879"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2473879-2473885">かず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2473885-2473909"><rb>淀川</rb><rt>よどがは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2473909-2473914">に</seg></p>
