>早速</rb><rt>さつそく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2854563-2854587">取押へ町名家主等</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2854587-2854614"><rb>相尋</rb><rt>あひたづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2854614-2854632">ね候へ共何か</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2854632-2854656"><rb>取留</rb><rt>とりとま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2854656-2854665">らぬ申</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2854665-2854683"><rb>口</rb><rt>くち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2854683-2854689">にて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2854689-2854710"><rb>至極</rb><rt>しごく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2854710-2854734"><rb>怪敷</rb><rt>あやしく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2854734-2854802">存じ候間其儘差出候に付御吟味下さるべく候以上</seg></p>
