        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-2889026-2890846"><seg source="#source-2889026-2889038">茲に又</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889038-2889062"><rb>駿府</rb><rt>すんぷ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889062-2889065">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889065-2889095"><rb>加番衆</rb><rt>かばんしゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889095-2889116">松平玄蕃頭殿の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889116-2889137"><rb>家來</rb><rt>けらい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889137-2889164">に石川安五郎と云ふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889164-2889197"><rb>若侍士</rb><rt>わかざむらひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889197-2889239">ありしが駿府二丁目の小松屋の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889239-2889254"><rb>抱</rb><rt>かゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889254-2889263">へ遊女</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889263-2889290"><rb>白妙</rb><rt>しろたへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889290-2889293">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889293-2889308"><rb>許</rb><rt>もと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889308-2889344">へ通ひ互ひに深くなるに付</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889344-2889362"><rb>廓</rb><rt>さと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889362-2889374">の金には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889374-2889389"><rb>迫</rb><rt>つま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889389-2889410">るの習ひ後には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889410-2889443"><rb>揚代金</rb><rt>あげだいきん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889443-2889446">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889446-2889464"><rb>滯</rb><rt>とゞこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889464-2889470">ほり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889470-2889494"><rb>娼妓</rb><rt>しやうぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2889494-2889497">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2889497-2889527"><rb>櫛笄</rb><rt>くしか