85262">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985262-2985286"><rb>密通</rb><rt>みつつう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985286-2985298">致し居り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985298-2985322"><rb>尋常</rb><rt><seg source="#source-2985307-2985313">なみ</seg><choice source="#source-2985313-2985319"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985322-2985346">ならぬ中ゆゑ親類</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985346-2985364"><rb>内</rb><rt>ない</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985364-2985388"><rb>相談</rb><rt>さうだん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985388-2985424">の上にて里へ金五十兩付て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985424-2985445"><rb>離縁</rb><rt>りえん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985445-2985508">いたし其後惣内と夫婦に相なり伯父九郎兵衞も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985508-2985532"><rb>介抱</rb><rt>かいはう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985532-2985565">人と名を付惣内母へ後家</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985565-2985589"><rb>入夫</rb><rt>にふふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985589-2985592">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985592-2985613"><rb>這入</rb><rt>はひり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985613-2985652">しなり又九助の親類共は私し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985652-2985667"><rb>姪</rb><rt>めひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985667-2985745">節を九助の妻に致し度段相談仕つるにより一方ならぬ深き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985745-2985760"><rb>縁</rb><rt>えん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985760-2985802">と存じ私し養女に致し同人方へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985802-2985817"><rb>遣</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985817-2985838">はせしなりと事</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985838-2985862"><rb>細密</rb><rt>こまか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2985862-2985892">に申ければ文左衞門は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2985892-2985913"><rb>委細</rb><rt>ゐ