        <p source="#source-3048718-3048789"><seg source="#source-3048718-3048736">享保二年五月</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-3048736-3048789" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(9)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=9"><seg source="#source-3048766-3048789">九郎兵衞（印）</seg></seg></p>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-3048789-3048857" style="padding-inline-end: 10em; text-align: right">
